From 34869cce2ea0dff793a499b83f65239d7e136ec2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:30:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 54/58] ple_offload: the dying-path traceback runs no exception
 code

ple_fail_closed formatted its traceback with traceback.format_exception, which
runs exception-defined __str__/__getattribute__; if one blocked, the rank never
reached os._exit(1) and kept its GPUs. A safe formatter reads frames and plain
string arguments only.
---
